WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
Let's drive there together

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:04,940
Is there someone to take care of you on the way? Since I'm along the way,

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:06,140
Then let's go together

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,960
If you want to fly with a flying pig during the day,

5
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,080
Too much noise

6
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,400
Easily monitored by research center satellites

7
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,440
Keep an eye on Hehuna

8
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,580
It only takes more than three hours to drive there.

9
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,380
It would be easier to send it to Wucheng along the way.

10
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,780
I really envy Sister Qingsi

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,140
Can go on a self-driving trip with the boss

12
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:23,580
If I had known earlier, I would have made up an excuse to stop by and clean it up.

13
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:26,660
Let’s meet at the garage in ten minutes and leave on time, okay?

14
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,180
I'll grab a carry-on bag and come down right away.

15
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,730
It turns out that it’s in the boss’s mind

16
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,370
Zhao Qian is really just a secretary

17
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,690
Not some unshakable decent girlfriend

18
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,410
Since everyone has the same starting point

19
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:37,810
Zhao Qian can fight

20
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:40,770
What's wrong with me, Liu Qingqiu, boss, listen to your wishes

21
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:43,170
You are completely free now, right? Pay attention to the road.

22
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,610
Aren't you tired of blinking your eyes along the way?

23
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:46,850
Are you admiring the handsome guy? Wucheng has arrived

24
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:48,010
This is my base camp

25
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:50,250
It’s more prosperous and lively than the countryside. Where do you plan to go first?

26
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,770
Just wait until dark over there in Shennongjia
